# The values that must never reach the public repository: account addresses,
# personal names, names of family members and companies, folder names from the
# sources, machine names, real document titles. The pre-push gate refuses a push
# when any of them appears in a tracked file, an added line or a commit message
# (scripts/private-values-check.mts).
#
# One value per line. Letter case is ignored. A value made of letters only
# matches whole words and may be as short as three letters (a short first name,
# an abbreviation); anything else matches anywhere and needs at least four
# characters. A shorter value is refused: it would match everywhere.
#
# The files this project receives from the blueprint (what `blueprint files`
# lists as managed) are exempt: they are already public in the blueprint's own
# repository and cannot be changed here. The check says how many were exempt.
# When that list cannot be read, nothing is exempt.
#
# This file is the tracked template, with invented values. Copy it to
# .private-values (untracked, gitignored) and replace them with the real ones.
quibblewick@example.test
Mablewood
Orinthia Mablewood
Zanthorp Holdings
Scans 2019 wobblecrest
glimmerfall-nas
Lease for the flat on Pemberly Row
